      Entry: 1
      Data: DialogueName
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Start the quest to retrieve the wind crystal. Give the player the sky
        engine piece to fix it. Require the player to fix the sky engine, fuel it,
        and kill some bats as well, then get the wind crystal. Mattie will remind
        the player of the task after the quest is started, and then thank the player
        after the quest is done, and should tell the player to see Hattie about what
        to do with the wind crystal, if that hasn't been done already.
